WEBVTT

00:00:06.641 --> 00:00:08.309
Sorry, I asked you not to.

00:00:09.268 --> 00:00:10.937
I know. I'm sorry.

00:00:11.854 --> 00:00:13.314
I can't help it.

00:00:14.607 --> 00:00:16.567
People are easiest to read
when they're hurting.

00:00:16.734 --> 00:00:17.819
I'm not hurting.

00:00:19.612 --> 00:00:21.406
Anyway, it was a long time ago.

00:00:30.498 --> 00:00:33.126
That was a real close friendship
you had at school.

00:00:35.795 --> 00:00:38.089
Neither of us really fitted in at school.

00:00:39.924 --> 00:00:42.051
-So, we became quite--
-You became real close?

00:00:44.345 --> 00:00:45.596
For years.

00:00:49.851 --> 00:00:51.269
She was a taker.

00:00:53.396 --> 00:00:54.772
You need a giver.

00:00:55.648 --> 00:00:57.400
What are you two talking about?

00:00:58.484 --> 00:00:59.485
NEWT: Uh, nothing.

00:01:00.153 --> 00:01:01.279
QUEENIE: School.

00:01:01.446 --> 00:01:03.114
-School.
-Did--

00:01:03.948 --> 00:01:05.283
Did you say school?

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:07.452
Is there a school?

00:01:07.618 --> 00:01:10.955
A wizardry school here in, uh, America?

00:01:11.539 --> 00:01:13.166
Of course. Ilvermorny.

00:01:13.332 --> 00:01:15.918
It's only the best wizard school
in the whole world.

00:01:16.127 --> 00:01:19.756
I think you'll find that the best
wizarding school in the world is Hogwarts.

00:01:20.631 --> 00:01:21.632
Hogwash.

00:01:23.342 --> 00:01:24.677
(THUNDER RUMBLING)

00:01:24.927 --> 00:01:25.970
(SCREECHING)

00:01:32.143 --> 00:01:33.144
NEWT: Danger.

00:01:36.314 --> 00:01:38.107
He senses danger.

00:01:48.951 --> 00:01:51.245
(DISTANT SOBBING)

00:02:16.020 --> 00:02:17.480
(SOBBING)

00:02:17.939 --> 00:02:20.441
The Obscurial was here.

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:21.984
Where did she go?

00:02:24.862 --> 00:02:26.197
Help me.

00:02:27.573 --> 00:02:28.866
Help me.

00:02:31.494 --> 00:02:33.746
Didn't you tell me you had another sister?

00:02:35.665 --> 00:02:37.166
(SOBBING) Please, help me.

00:02:37.875 --> 00:02:39.961
-Where's your other sister, Credence?
-I need help.

00:02:40.127 --> 00:02:42.046
The little one. Where did she go?

00:02:42.213 --> 00:02:44.131
-Please, just help me.
-(GRUNTS)

00:02:46.342 --> 00:02:49.220
Your sister's in grave danger.

00:02:50.847 --> 00:02:52.056
We need to find her.

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:02.900
GRAVES: What is this place?

00:03:03.234 --> 00:03:05.403
CREDENCE: Ma adopted Modesty out of here.

00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:07.238
From a family of 12.

00:03:08.030 --> 00:03:11.242
She misses her brothers and sisters.
She still talks about them.

00:03:13.703 --> 00:03:15.204
Where is she?

00:03:16.998 --> 00:03:18.249
I don't know.

00:03:19.959 --> 00:03:21.335
You're a Squib, Credence.

00:03:22.587 --> 00:03:25.131
I could smell it off you
the minute I met you.

00:03:26.382 --> 00:03:27.383
What?

00:03:29.093 --> 00:03:31.304
You have magical ancestry but no power.

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:33.931
But you said you could teach me.

00:03:34.098 --> 00:03:35.308
You're unteachable.

00:03:35.975 --> 00:03:36.976
Your mother's dead.

00:03:37.768 --> 00:03:39.103
That's your reward.

00:03:40.438 --> 00:03:41.939
I'm done with you.

00:03:49.071 --> 00:03:50.531
(WHIMPERING)

00:03:50.698 --> 00:03:52.033
Modesty?

00:04:04.003 --> 00:04:05.463
Modesty.

00:04:06.672 --> 00:04:10.760
There's no need to be afraid.

00:04:12.553 --> 00:04:14.805
I'm here with your brother, Credence.

00:04:19.977 --> 00:04:21.479
Out you come now.

00:04:21.812 --> 00:04:22.897
(HISSING)

00:04:23.147 --> 00:04:24.148
(CEILING CRACKING)

00:04:28.152 --> 00:04:30.154
(RUMBLING)

00:04:56.764 --> 00:04:57.848
Credence.

00:04:59.183 --> 00:05:01.394
I owe you an apology.

00:05:02.353 --> 00:05:04.021
I trusted you.

00:05:07.233 --> 00:05:08.693
I thought you were my friend.

00:05:09.443 --> 00:05:11.028
I thought you were different.

00:05:13.364 --> 00:05:14.824
You can control it.

00:05:15.908 --> 00:05:17.076
Credence.

00:05:22.415 --> 00:05:24.792
I don't think I want to, Mr. Graves.

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:32.800
(ROARING)

00:05:35.594 --> 00:05:36.637
(PEOPLE SCREAMING)

00:05:44.937 --> 00:05:48.232
SQUIRE'S

00:05:50.359 --> 00:05:52.737
JACOB: Is that it?
That's the Obscurial thing?

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:57.241
That's more powerful
than any Obscurial I've ever heard of.

00:06:01.537 --> 00:06:03.330
If I don't come back,

00:06:03.497 --> 00:06:04.957
look after my creatures.

00:06:05.916 --> 00:06:08.919
Everything that you need to know
is in there.

00:06:10.087 --> 00:06:11.297
What?

00:06:11.464 --> 00:06:13.257
They're not killing it.

00:06:15.926 --> 00:06:16.927
Newt!

00:06:17.845 --> 00:06:19.764
You heard him. Look after them.

00:06:21.766 --> 00:06:23.059
Keep hold of that, honey.

00:06:23.434 --> 00:06:26.187
-No, no, no, no.
-(PANTING)

00:06:26.645 --> 00:06:28.272
I can't take you.

00:06:29.356 --> 00:06:32.234
-Please, let go of me, Jacob.
-Hey. Hey.

00:06:32.610 --> 00:06:34.779
You're the one
that said I was one of yous.

00:06:35.029 --> 00:06:36.072
Right?

00:06:36.238 --> 00:06:38.074
It's too dangerous.

00:06:47.708 --> 00:06:49.752
(PEOPLE SCREAMING)

